    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/cd94483ab2aef979cd3d565ae03337b3.poster.avif?t=1747721067\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/cd94483ab2aef979cd3d565ae03337b3.webm?t=1747721067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/cd94483ab2aef979cd3d565ae03337b3.mp4?t=1747721067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Watch out! The terrifying sexy water ghost is here!&quot;<br>One day, the village where she lived became very strange. The roads were flooded, and no people were in sight.<br><br><strong>Hide or Fight</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/fb7a8971e29e89528ff003a7bab9597b.poster.avif?t=1747721067\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/fb7a8971e29e89528ff003a7bab9597b.webm?t=1747721067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/fb7a8971e29e89528ff003a7bab9597b.mp4?t=1747721067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The terrifying sexy water ghost is extremely powerful.<br>She must, whenever possible, avoid the ghost\u2019s harm or sometimes repel the ghost with a handgun.<br><br><strong>State: Soaked in water </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/d4def875876af4dba19e5317d0c3a687.poster.avif?t=1747721067\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/d4def875876af4dba19e5317d0c3a687.webm?t=1747721067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/d4def875876af4dba19e5317d0c3a687.mp4?t=1747721067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Jumping into the water or being hit by an enemy\u2019s water magic attack will put you in a soaked state.<br><br>Will you dive into the water to escape immediate danger?<br>Or will you fight the enemy and endure no matter what?<br><br><strong>Parry in emergencies</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/c8ff855d769ee8e2211c98f4cb71f442.poster.avif?t=1747721067\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/c8ff855d769ee8e2211c98f4cb71f442.webm?t=1747721067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558300/extras/c8ff855d769ee8e2211c98f4cb71f442.mp4?t=1747721067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dealing with the terrifying sexy water ghost up close with a handgun is difficult.<br>In such moments, parry the enemy\u2019s attack and gift them a powerful roundhouse kick.",
